{"id":4980,"date":"2026-04-27T04:28:22","date_gmt":"2026-04-27T04:28:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/apexmedicaloman.com\/?page_id=4980"},"modified":"2026-04-27T04:43:05","modified_gmt":"2026-04-27T04:43:05","slug":"plastic-surgery","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/apexmedicaloman.com\/plastic-surgery\/","title":{"rendered":"PLASTIC SURGERY"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"4980\" class=\"elementor elementor-4980\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-179aa74d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"179aa74d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f9b6d47 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"7f9b6d47\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-572b0a26 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"572b0a26\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-793c443e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"793c443e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Plastic Surgery<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2511dddf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2511dddf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3696e79c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3696e79c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac291ab e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ac291ab\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-246f285e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"246f285e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45f66e7d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"45f66e7d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43e83a55 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"43e83a55\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our experienced surgeons specialize in both reconstructive and cosmetic procedures, delivering safe, precise, and natural-looking results that enhance confidence and overall appearance.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b606513 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6b606513\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">We offer a wide range of plastic surgery treatments designed to improve form, function, and aesthetics. From facial enhancement and body contouring to reconstructive procedures after injury or medical conditions, every treatment plan is carefully customized to meet the unique needs of each patient.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c73df5e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6c73df5e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Patient safety, comfort, and satisfaction are at the heart of our approach. Using advanced surgical techniques and modern medical technology, our team ensures every procedure is performed with the highest standards of care, precision, and professionalism.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a190c06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6a190c06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">We believe plastic surgery is not only about appearance but also about restoring confidence and improving quality of life. Our compassionate specialists guide you through every step of the journey, from consultation to recovery, ensuring natural results and a positive experience.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Plastic Surgery Our experienced surgeons specialize in both reconstructive and cosmetic procedures, delivering safe, precise, and natural-looking results that enhance [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-head